Z||000022||Ken Wittlief||06-29-2001||02:26 PM||||On your first dates try to avoid the cliche stuff like movies or things where you are a spectator.<P>  get out and do something real together - rent a jet ski or a hobiecat - go skydiving - horseback riding - take a ride in a ballon<P>  take a one hour train ride to another city and go to dinner somewhere - of take a short day trip on a commercial flight<P>  if your gonna do an 'entertainment' thing its gotta be special - like a concert or a play<P>   ask her stuff she has always wanted to do and then take her out and do that.<P>   you want her to be sitting at home the next night thinking to herself "Wow I never met anyone like him before!"||||reg||1
